    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bál slahhángw mibaá nee tsár kudá' ta bay Adari tawa mibaá nee tám, iwa xeér, an baalaadár hara'ayár waawutmo kawa boo/eesi, wakuusér múk Yahudi gana harahhíf múk Yahudi nguwa bal, naxés ado ina warqeér, wakuuseedá' kari baál baalaadár kilae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baalaadae múk Yahudi tana burumburiít baraá gixsaduuín awa baraá ayeemo sleémeero awa waawutmo Ahasuero, as mukdá' inooín gi slahh'eemisuú wa slaá' kuwa i haratlay. Tam heé inooín gaa tlampa'aas i kaahh, asma muu sleémeero inooín gina da'ayuút. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk urén oo ayeemo sleémeero, nee geeraharuusér slaqwaruuse, nee ga/awuuse nee sagadiyuusér waawutmo, múk Yahudi nguna alee/iisiyé', asma Mordekai nguna da'ayutiyé'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma Mordekai a heé úr doó waawutmoowo, nee xirfuuwós ina xu'utiít baraá ayeemo sleémeero, asma aleesleemuú Mordekai ina ak doogiigín. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy múk Yahudi wakuuser'ín kari muúx sleémeero ar paangadu nee kay tsuú/, nee kiri hhaamiís. Múk Yahudi adoodá' i slai gana tleéhh dír mukdá' inooín ngaa aahhiye'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tam baraá gixsár ur ar Susaro múk Yahudi múk tsiire kooán guna tsuú/ nee ngiri hhaamiisiyé'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk hatlá' oo taa tsuú/ a kwí: Parshandata nee Dalfoni nee Aspata, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nee Porata, nee Adalia nee Aridata, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nee Parmashta, nee Arisai, nee Aridai, nee Waisata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukwí an daaqoó mibaangw oo Hamani garmoó Hamedata, wakusmoó múk Yahudi, ala muruuín kwaa haasaáng wa hayohiiká.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baalaadár kilae waawutmo kuri faarór mukdá' taa tsuú/í huúw baraá gixsár Susa wa alé. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawutmo waawuto'o Esta gari báy, «Múk Yahudi muu ngwa tsu/iyé' tsiire kooán baraá gixsarí ur ar Susaro, dinkwa nee daaqoó mibaangw oo Hamani. Xáy, gár ta tleehhi a milá baraá ayeemaá hatlá' naa meetiye' awa waawutmoowo? Firoorók a milá? Kiíng ti qáy. Gár ta sla' a milá aáma? Tam tlaqtá waawuti'iima kingi haniis.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy Esta iri ó', «Waawutmo birngi slaa', áx múk Yahudi kuduú baraá Susa ku pa/ángw i haniisi matlo, as adoorí laarí taa tleéhh kawa tleehhi, nee daaqaysíng mibaangw oo Hamani ku tarerein gawaá xaai.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawutmo adoodá' gari oó' kawa tleehhi, afo gari ilahariís baraá Susa, daaqaydá' mibaangw oo Hamani kuri tarereín. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bál slahhángw mibaá nee tsár kudá' ta bay Adari tawa mibaá nee tsiyáhh, múk Yahudi kuduú baraá gixsár Susa tari burumburiít, múk tsiire tám kuri tsuú/ baraá gixsár Susaro. Ala muruuín ngwaa haasaáng wa ar tlay'iiká.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk Yahudi oo hatlá' oo baraá ayeemaá waawutmoó hootá' tana burumburiít slafingw'ín nguwa xuna', amohhooa kay sláy dír wakuuser'ine, kudá' inooín ngi ahhiitá' kina tsuú/ muu kume mibeeri faanqw nee kooán, ala baraá muruuine gár taa haasaáng wa ar tláy i káhh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adoorí iwa tleehharút a slahhángw mibaá nee tsár kudá' ta bay Adari tawa mibaá nee tám, nee bál mibaá nee tsiyáhh ar slahhaangwí tana hungu/uús, kay deelór muruú /ayma nee qwala/ tleéhh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala múk Yahudi kuduú baraá gixsár Susa, tana burumburiít bál slahhaangw tawa mibaá nee tám nee tawa mibaá nee tsiyáhh. Aluuwo bál mibaá nee kooán, tana hungu/uús, baalaadá' kay deelór ur ar muruú /ayma nee qwala/ tleéhh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe, múk Yahudi kuduú baraá ayeemo nee baraá gixsadaá koo/ír gawit ngi kooma'aaká, deeloorí kana óh, ar mibaá nee tsiyáhh slahhángw Adari, tawa deelór muruú /ayma nee qwala/ nee deelór tiwa qeemií ya/abitiya'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy Mordekai kaangwí gway gooín, inós barwadu gay ya/aáw amór múk Yahudi kuduú baraá ayeemo sleémeero awa baraá waawuti'iimár waawutmo Ahasuero, kudá' tsewen nee awa sawene, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "as muu nguwa ádbáy kahhó' bál mibaá nee tsiyáhh nee bál mibaá nee kooán ar slahhángw Adari kawa inslaslay umuúqo kurko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma deeloorí an deelór múk Yahudi amohhooa ngiwa slayé' dír wakuuser'ine, nee an slahhángw gurhaami kawa warqeés tawa qwala/, nee an deelór tsuunqumis kuwa warqeés tawa deelór ur. Múk Yahudi kuna ádbáy deeloorí ngiwa oohiya', ngiwa deelór ur tleehhiya' nee ar qwala/, nee qeemuú dimbadimbé kuwa hanmiisi dír muu nee dír narkuute. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk Yahudi adoodá' ngiri ya/ané' ar adoodá' ngira geerií tleehhiyé', nee ar adoodá' Mordekai ngira gooín.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma Hamani garmoó Hamedata oo Agagi, wakusmoó múk Yahudi sleémeero, ina tsabín múk Yahudi nguwa hhaamisi. Nee tsawdoodá' ta bay Puri gana tleéhh as múk Yahudi nguwa hhaamisi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala qoomár Esta iwa amór waawutmoó keér, waawutmo hara'aya gari oó' barwadu kiwa gooin as adoodá' tlaakw Hamani aa qoomeés daanduú múk Yahudiro kawa gawaawós i tleehhi nee daaqaywós kuwa tarereín gawaá xa'ano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe, baalaadá' kari báy Purimu as /aymuuwí ta bay Puri",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9:26",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Puri:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Gídaabárós a tsawdo.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " an tsawdo. Asma barwaduuká' Mordekai aa gooín nee as muruuwí múk Yahudi gwaa slay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk Yahudi deeloorí tsár gari qaás tawa dawa dir'ine nee dír na/ii'ine, nee dír mukdá' sleémeero aa dir'ín i haragwaa', matawa baloó slaaqaát deeloorí tsár inslaslaango qoomaarós bira xeér, umuúqo kurko, ar adoodá' Mordekai ngira gooín. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As kahhó' deeloorí kawa inslaslay nee kawa oohi nee qari sleémeero umuúqo do'o, baraá umuúqo ayko nee umuúqo gixsaro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tam deeloorír Purimu makawa baloó slaáx nee makawa máy, inslaslaangós miwa alhhe'eesuút dír xwaylar'ine.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
